{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Pirate Party Mayhem With Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannonball Crew is a chaotic online party game where two teams face off in intense matches full of treasure hunting, sword showdowns, and cannon-fueled mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for online play with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recommended for 2 to 20 players, with support for up to 40. AI can fill in any empty spots.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605030/extras/298443cab83d8164c9e663af9ee64704.poster.avif?t=1751664255\" width=600 height=207 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605030/extras/298443cab83d8164c9e663af9ee64704.webm?t=1751664255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Path to Victory With Different Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match game modes to create the perfect chaotic pirate showdown for you and your friends. The team with the highest score when time runs out wins the match.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Deathmatch</strong> \u2013 Take out enemies to earn points for your team. Win fights, win points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounty Hunt</strong> \u2013 Random players become high-value targets for a limited time. Take them out to receive bonus points before the opportunity vanishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure Hunt</strong> \u2013 Search the map for treasure, hide it on your team's side to score, and defend it from rival pirates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605030/extras/5cec13a388253009066b4aff5985d197.poster.avif?t=1751664255\" width=600 height=203 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605030/extras/5cec13a388253009066b4aff5985d197.webm?t=1751664255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons and Combat Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture</strong> \u2013 Send enemies to prison and earn clues about their hidden treasures \u2014 but beware, they\u2019ll escape after a while or if a teammate sets them free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword</strong> \u2013 Wield your sword to fend off enemies trying to capture or attack you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harpoon</strong> \u2013 Use the harpoon to pull yourself forward, drag enemies closer, or grab distant crates and treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cannon</strong> \u2013 Fire explosive cannonballs to clear your path and send foes flying!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605030/extras/e894f60c9a621a1526c05007ecb92057.poster.avif?t=1751664255\" width=600 height=207 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605030/extras/e894f60c9a621a1526c05007ecb92057.webm?t=1751664255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Cannonball Crew Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From last-second treasure thefts to explosive battles, Cannonball Crew is packed with action, strategy, and laughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your pirate friends!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1605030?t=1751664255","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1605030?t=1751664255","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605030/006ff979cc5c4f9443876972ba844eb213abe3da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751664255","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605030/006ff979cc5c4f9443876972ba844eb213abe3da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751664255","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Pirate Party Mayhem With Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannonball Crew is a chaotic online party game where two teams face off in intense matches full of treasure hunting, sword showdowns, and cannon-fueled mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for online play with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recommended for 2 to 20 players, with support for up to 40. AI can fill in any empty spots.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605030/extras/298443cab83d8164c9e663af9ee64704.poster.avif?t=1751664255\" width=600 height=207 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605030/extras/298443cab83d8164c9e663af9ee64704.webm?t=1751664255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Path to Victory With Different Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match game modes to create the perfect chaotic pirate showdown for you and your friends. The team with the highest score when time runs out wins the match.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Deathmatch</strong> \u2013 Take out enemies to earn points for your team. Win fights, win points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounty Hunt</strong> \u2013 Random players become high-value targets for a limited time. Take them out to receive bonus points before the opportunity vanishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure Hunt</strong> \u2013 Search the map for treasure, hide it on your team's side to score, and defend it from rival pirates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605030/extras/5cec13a388253009066b4aff5985d197.poster.avif?t=1751664255\" width=600 height=203 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605030/extras/5cec13a388253009066b4aff5985d197.webm?t=1751664255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons and Combat Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture</strong> \u2013 Send enemies to prison and earn clues about their hidden treasures \u2014 but beware, they\u2019ll escape after a while or if a teammate sets them free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword</strong> \u2013 Wield your sword to fend off enemies trying to capture or attack you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harpoon</strong> \u2013 Use the harpoon to pull yourself forward, drag enemies closer, or grab distant crates and treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cannon</strong> \u2013 Fire explosive cannonballs to clear your path and send foes flying!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605030/extras/e894f60c9a621a1526c05007ec